{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852746408783904798","name":"crepes-and-crits-cafe☕🐈","position":77,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"Run by Eliot, an immigrant human, and staffed with animals, the crepes and crits cafe is a popular hangout spot for the young children with animal features who sleep in the parks of ferrytown.","type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Sabrine nods. 'I see... when I first witnessed Kukudh die, I could barely cope, and it must be so much worse for you...' she reaches out to comfort them.","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:36:26.308000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877833376478920705","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Ferrah grips their hand tighter. The tortle man looks at Prosser straight on for the first time all night.","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:36:52.450000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877833486126436352","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"“One last insult for giving them so much trouble, then?” She takes a sip. “Now I really can’t argue your hatred.”","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:36:58.715000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877833512403755030","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"I'm sorry if I offended you. Just remembered our first meeting, when we noticed the similarity, and you remarked what a trick it would have been.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:38:58.679000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877834015569227827","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"When Gaillardia brought me back, I always asked myself what the feeling of death was actually like, what words I could put towards that feeling...\" Irynx thinks out loud. \"It's like, shattering, breaking into a million pieces. Infinite, everywhere.\"\n\nShe looks at Prosser. \"I can only imagine how that feels for you. To shatter into a million pieces, and come back incomplete.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:45:26.895000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-19T08:47:30.999000Z","id":"877835643865149471","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"They nod slowly. \"They figured we'd be too busy going after each other to work together. And for a while, they were right. We went our separate ways and did our own things, but we kept drifting back towards each other. Eventually, we agreed we were better off together than apart. We made up. But we still said so many hurtful things to each other...\" They begin to cry silent tears once more.","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:46:54.881000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877836012905189446","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"“That happens with every family. Probably feels worse when it’s yourself, and probably harder to mend too.” She goes a bit quiet and stops, the look on her face showing her feeling of talking too much on something she couldn’t understand from their perspective.","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:49:39.021000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877836701358235669","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"she holds out the cloth to them again.","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:50:19.178000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877836869788925962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Ferrah drapes an arm over their shoulders. \"They loved you and you both agreed to put those words behind you. We all fight with ourselves sometimes.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:51:28.503000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877837160559038525","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"she nods. 'I was stuck in self-hatred for so long as a corpse, but... that's behind me now. As sounds like that should be.'","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:52:33.296000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877837432320561192","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"'I can't say I have experience with what's /supposed/ to happen to someone after death. But I know when I was a floating spirit, all I worried for was the welfare of those I cared about.'","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:54:18.479000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877837873490067488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"They nod and smile at Ferrah. \"I knew the moment they got impaled on that foul spike they were going to die. I could feel it. And I also knew in that moment that there was no way to bring them back.\" They begin to sob louder now. \"Neither of us were ever a whole being since the split happened. They'd be willing to come back, but there just isn't a whole spirit out there for the magic to latch onto.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:55:08.740000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877838084299952149","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"'...I apologise if this is false hope or anything... but I'm wondering, could they somehow latch back onto you?'","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:55:51.903000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877838265338703903","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"'It wouldn't bring them a body back, unless you could fashion one for them like I do for Kukudh, but... they'd be with you, watching over you.'","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:56:15.190000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877838363011448892","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Not to be... well, me, but what if they already are?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:57:37.965000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877838710194982912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"They just shake their head slowly. \"That mist that came out of their mouth, and went into me was all that's left. And I don't feel a damn bit different. We could always talk to each other freely, and well... I haven't heard or felt anything.\" They sigh. \"I think it's just me now. And i've never felt so lonely.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:58:49.264000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877839009244659762","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Kukudh flies over to sit on their shoulder. `Would you want me to stay with you for now? I know it wouldn't be the same at all, but... so you're at least not alone.`","created_at":"2021-08-19T08:59:43.313000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877839235942584320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"'I can teach you the ritual I use for Kukudh, if you want. Just to at least try it.'","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:00:11.199000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877839352904949771","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"You're lonely not because nobody is with you but because you are not with you. That's understandable.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:00:16.878000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877839376724418591","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Secel nods. “I can’t begin to imagine what it’s like.”","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:00:57.610000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877839547566796851","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"They nod to Irynx. \"I'm both here, and yet profoundly not.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:01:17.695000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877839631809392650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Despite the court's intentions, you both managed to overcome the hardships and got back together. Perhaps it's that bond and the time you spent together, rather than the disagreements prior to that, that should live on in our memories. I want to believe that Trapero lives on as part of you, both literally and in your memories.\" Roy says, but is fully ready to stop there to not make things worse for Prosser.","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:01:25.372000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877839664009076756","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Reminds me of something I heard once, in another life.\" She looks at Roy, then recites a quote as best she can from memory. \"'Even if you are not with me, the memories of you are with me. My heart sees you, even if you are made vanished from my vision.'\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:02:38.306000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877839969916428308","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Sabrine looks like she's going to cry at the quote.","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:04:12.774000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877840366143963176","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"They nod and fall silent for a bit.","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:05:05.214000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877840586093252628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"If... if it's not too much to ask,\" she takes a deep breath. \"Did you have a name, in the Feywild? Before Prosser and Trapero?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:05:39.310000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877840729102221352","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"We did. But... it doesn't really feel like me anymore. I'v changed so much since then. So had they.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:07:50.771000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877841280489639997","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"(sounds like a deadname to me, so I won't ask)\nshe nods. 'Perhaps better to leave it in the past, then.'","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:09:26.827000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877841683377696808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"(less a deadname and more they just don't really vibe with it any more)\n(so i guess a deadname a little bit? idk, i wouldn't classifiy it as such)","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:10:22.403000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877841916480339978","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Another life. I get that.\" She tries to be quiet, but can't. \".....We won't forget Trapero's.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:10:37.685000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877841980577710120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"she nods. 'Absolutely.'","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:11:37.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877842232261103676","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
