{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"They nod, seeming pleased. \"That was always the joke. We were the blueberry kid.\" They smile wryly, but clearly are still quite sad.","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:22:54.188000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877845069695180820","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
